      {
        "author_name": "Vicky macfarlane",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116350995426157788992/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIt5hAEthxZGJpd_mJ9bRU3T1O-XGn90LOtIGmH7lZyT_2LfQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "This place always has fresh and great tasting meals. Perfect for lunch and a delicious supper when I don't feel like cooking. Would recommend to anyone.😊",
        "time": 1713710616,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jamie Bourque",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105182397921017723508/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZjNuomWT6dAw6L7oAletR2HRygpu9dx4IQrUCsWAtocDorW_9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I regularly buy prepared food/meals to help feed my elderly relatives and my family as well.  The food is freshly prepared and they use quality ingredients.  The soups are hearty and delicious.  A great way to get a reasonably priced meal on the table on those nights were you just have no time.",
        "time": 1631490854,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "JL -",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104400629945805858602/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7AdPLLLmREdN0F8_GuxQsIhjRluSrdZUzaq7fSK0b3gRXMm-L=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "I'd like to leave a recommendation but can't.  Tried their quiche, at $15 it was dry, all the filling had gone under the crust and stuck to the aluminum - I've never seen that happen before!  Can do better at local grocery store for $8.  Tried their Swedish meatballs but it was too salty to eat.  The quiche had very little salt, probably not enough - go figure!  So prices were high, quality was low (Dec 2020).",
        "time": 1609875426,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "HF7132",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104202253062224724435/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUS9cqf-BIZW4qOgeWC24KMWe3LgXc4sIM3p15H7Px2efNFPCmR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "So tasty! The crab cakes are especially great, they’re honestly better than what I’ve had in restaurants. And very friendly service :D",
        "time": 1638902914,
